Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

2. Character artwork (art/frames/)

The character is a popular fan-made anthropomorphic "Claude" design from the
Chinese community; it is not original to this repository and the rights to the
original design belong to its creator. The frames here are a fan redraw of that
design and are NOT covered by the license above. They are shared for personal,
non-commercial use only. If you are the original creator and object, please
open an issue and they will be removed.

3. Trademark

This is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.
"Claude" is a trademark of Anthropic.

